
This is a LaTeX package for creating presentations that can be seen on a
computer screen or projected on to a bigger screen with the help of a
projector.  The description of the files are as follows.

talkpal.sty : The style file that is necessary for creating the
presentation.  It should be kept either in the area where all
tex/latex distribution files are kept on the computer.  Alternatively,
it can be put in any directory, but then it will work only within that
directory.

talkpal-doc.pdf : A pdf file which explains how to use the package.  It
also serves as a sample of the use of talkpal, since it has been created
by using talkpal.

talkpal-doc.tex : A .tex file that uses talkpal.sty and creates
talkpal-doc.pdf.

The package is protected under GPL (General Public License).  